WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.640
- It's time to crack open our vaults

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:03.610
of never before seen footage.

00:00:03.610 --> 00:00:05.400
We're starting with a hilarious story,

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.350
actor, Jonathan Tucker told me.

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:09.868
I don't think this needs
any setup, you're welcome.

00:00:09.868 --> 00:00:13.510
Well, Jonathan, you posted
this family portrait.

00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:15.180
Let's see it, here we go.

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:16.013
- [Guest] Aw!

00:00:16.013 --> 00:00:18.264
- [Kelly] Like, oh no,
you are quickly, my man,

00:00:18.264 --> 00:00:22.030
not only is this not your family,

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:23.730
it's one of the greatest,

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:26.370
you're the funniest guest I've ever had.

00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:27.203
I need you to know that.

00:00:27.203 --> 00:00:28.440
- Wait, it is his family, right?

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:30.328
- It's not his family!

00:00:30.328 --> 00:00:31.170
(audience laugh)

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:33.580
Why, so tell us what has happened

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:35.163
- I play a lot of serious roles,

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.480
so I'm glad that you're pulling
out the humorous side of me

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:40.740
'cause I feel like some
people always think

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:43.330
I'm like the bad guy
or the ultra dramatic.

00:00:43.330 --> 00:00:45.990
But you know, I love to
have fun, I love pranks.

00:00:45.990 --> 00:00:47.430
I've got great next door neighbors,

00:00:47.430 --> 00:00:49.630
Sean and Leslie and
their two beautiful kids.

00:00:49.630 --> 00:00:51.070
And we un-burgle a lot.

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:52.110
You know, every time we go over,

00:00:52.110 --> 00:00:54.040
we drop something off,
try to hide it away,

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:55.810
tuck it away in their house.

00:00:55.810 --> 00:00:57.770
And they actually just moved recently

00:00:57.770 --> 00:01:01.230
and discovered a whole slew
of items from wedding gifts

00:01:01.230 --> 00:01:02.780
that my wife and I had from 10 years ago

00:01:02.780 --> 00:01:04.640
that we couldn't bear to get rid of

00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:08.430
except in their, you
know, closet and bathroom,

00:01:08.430 --> 00:01:11.010
and other parts of their house.

00:01:11.010 --> 00:01:14.550
But Sean was away, you know, dad was away,

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:16.730
and Leslie decided she
was going to do this

00:01:16.730 --> 00:01:19.830
mother/daughter family photo shoot.

00:01:19.830 --> 00:01:21.570
So I looked out the window and you know,

00:01:21.570 --> 00:01:22.940
they're wearing all the same outfits

00:01:22.940 --> 00:01:24.887
and the photographer's
out there snapping away.

00:01:24.887 --> 00:01:27.670
I was like, "You know what
Sean really would love?

00:01:27.670 --> 00:01:32.460
Sean would love a photo of
me stepping into his shoes

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:34.573
in the matching blue and white outfit,

00:01:34.573 --> 00:01:36.470
holding his daughter."

00:01:36.470 --> 00:01:39.240
If you noticed there,
Kelly, you'll see my hand,

00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:42.590
my left hand, it's holding Leslie's arm,

00:01:42.590 --> 00:01:45.320
in a gentle embrace, letting her know

00:01:45.320 --> 00:01:47.950
that should anything happen
there's always somebody

00:01:47.950 --> 00:01:48.783
there to help her out.

00:01:48.783 --> 00:01:50.430
- A gentle embrace?

00:01:50.430 --> 00:01:52.588
- Sean returned a few weeks later.

00:01:52.588 --> 00:01:54.750
He was thrilled!

00:01:54.750 --> 00:01:58.110
He's a hot shot talent agent
and all of his clients,

00:01:58.110 --> 00:02:01.980
you know, are requesting
photos of this prank.

00:02:01.980 --> 00:02:03.560
So it's been a lot of fun.

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:06.840
- It is the greatest prank ever.

00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:07.690
- That's amazing.
- Thanks.

00:02:07.690 --> 00:02:09.510
- When I saw the photo, I was
like, oh, that's so sweet,

00:02:09.510 --> 00:02:11.564
that's his family and they
were like, no, it's not.

00:02:11.564 --> 00:02:14.360
(everyone laughs)

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:15.260
It's so great.

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:17.320
You're freaking hilarious.

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:18.689
And just so bold, just be like, yeah,

00:02:18.689 --> 00:02:19.989
I'm just going to play dad

